WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:05.600
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie I’ve almost
settled on a name, so pretty soon my hello

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.729
and the high five stuff will change.

00:00:07.729 --> 00:00:08.940
This week is like the big week to start getting
ready for everything.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.940
This video is going to be my Agents Of SHIELD
season 2 preview.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.450
They’ve cast a bunch of big characters from
the comics and they will be doing a big crossover

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.010
with Avengers 2 when it comes out next spring.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:19.750
So I’m going to start with what the new
arc of the season is, then do new characters

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:22.320
and then explain what’s going on with the
movie crossover.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.540
Hello new people, if you’re just finding
me for the first time I’m doing weekly Marvel

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.710
and SHIELD videos all season, be sure to subscribe
to get everything.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:32.800
I’m also working on a new giveaway that
I’ll explain at the end.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.719
So starting off, if you missed last season,
careful for spoilers from the finale.

00:00:35.719 --> 00:00:39.329
I’m going to have to explain season 2 by
talking about season 1.

00:00:39.329 --> 00:00:42.859
So I’ll wait just a sec...okay, here we
go.

00:00:42.859 --> 00:00:49.120
There is a time gap between the end of season
1 and the beginning of season 2.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.499
Skye is now in full on agent mode.

00:00:51.499 --> 00:00:55.620
Coulson has been director of SHIELD for about
6 months and HYDRA Ward is still in a holding

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.620
cell.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:59.639
He’s still part of the show, he’ll just
be the Loki of the season.

00:00:59.639 --> 00:01:02.829
The bad boy they stick in a holding cell when
they don’t need him for a special mission.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:06.280
Oh yes, they’re definitely going to let
him out for some super special missions this

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:07.280
year.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:09.930
They did it with Loki in Dark World, they’ll
do it with Ward.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:13.380
I love that he grew a beard, just to let you
know he’s extra bad.

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:16.450
Like motorcycle riding, chain smoking bad.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:18.950
Just kidding, I’m so much more happy with
what they did with his character in the last

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:19.950
few episodes of season 1.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:24.009
If you watched any of my season 1 videos,
you know I was not a fan of quarterback Ward.

00:01:24.009 --> 00:01:25.649
HYDRA Ward is way more fun.

00:01:25.649 --> 00:01:28.350
This is why you stick with the show, they
had the plan all along.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:40.520
There are a couple of big arcs they tee up
in episode 1.

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:41.520
All the Kree Code.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:45.100
I’m calling it Kree right now, but there’s
also a slim chance it could be inhumans related.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:48.890
But feel free to suggest alternatives if you
think you have it figured out.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:52.090
That will be Skye’s standing order in between
regular missions.

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:54.450
Decode the symbols.

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:59.020
The other big running plot will be cleaning
up the remainders of HYDRA.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:11.370
To that end, they have several new big comic
book characters, in addition Lucy Lawless

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:20.230
and a couple of Dollhouse Whedonverse people
are joining the cast as new characters that

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:23.600
aren’t from the comics.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:30.420
Lucy Lawless is playing another Veteran Agent
who will be someone Coulson goes to for help.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.450
Being Lucy Lawless, you can expect her to
be a total badass.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:37.960
I think the only show I ever saw her on where
she wasn’t a little bit scary was Parks

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:43.100
and Rec.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:50.060
The biggest new comic book character is going
to be Mockingbird, played by Adrienne Palicki.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:53.770
She had a big part in the Secret Avengers
storyline with Hawkeye.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:58.300
That all went down after the big Civil War
event.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:02.200
She was injected with some super soldier serum
that slowed down her aging process and made

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:05.760
her really strong, but I don’t know if the
show is going to do that.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:08.880
It’s like a lesser version of Captain America’s
enhancements.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:12.950
She’s also a super smart biochemist, so
think of her as being like May and Simmons

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:14.200
combined.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.871
Season 2 is going to feature a lot of new
badass women which I’m sure they’ll use

00:03:17.871 --> 00:03:26.850
for some awkward comedy with the bigger dudes
like Tripplet and Ward.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:31.430
Daniel Whitehall, who you might recognize
from Dollhouse or other Joss Whedon whatnot

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:32.950
is playing Kraken.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:35.410
He’s going to be one of the big villains.

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:39.590
In the comics, he’s a legendary HYDRA agent
who has this special helmet that works a little

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:40.590
like Iron Man Armor.

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:45.150
When he puts it on, he’s encased in hyper
advanced armor and the helmet itself works

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:47.260
a little like the helmet of fate.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:52.630
In that it imbues some of it’s own personality
on to who ever wears it.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:55.900
This doesn’t necessarily mean he’s going
to be the big bad.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:59.230
Because remember at the end of season 1 we
got the tease about Skye’s Father.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:01.460
They cast Kyle Maclachlan as that character,
he’s playing Skye’s father.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:09.010
We don’t know anything else about the character
other than he’s a little bit sinister.

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:10.820
If you ever watched him on How I Met Your
Mother.

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:13.200
Think of him as being like the Scary Face
Captain.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:18.209
I’m also hoping they work in some really
trippy Twin Peaks references.

00:04:18.209 --> 00:04:28.510
Also rounding out the rogues gallery is Lance
Hunter who’s playing Nick Blood.

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:31.620
He’s going to be a non-friendly that Coulson
goes to for help.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:34.790
He’s not a comic book character but he does
lead STRIKE.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:37.790
Which is like a British SHIELD type organization.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:43.070
The acronym stands for Special Tactical Reserve
for International Key Emergencies.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:47.100
Pretty much everybody that’s still alive
is coming back though, Triplett will still

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:53.770
be part of the team and Patton Oswalt will
show up on occasion.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:57.430
I’m still thinking he’s a Life Model Decoy.

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:01.920
Or he just has a twin he never mentioned.

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:05.630
There will be more comic book characters coming,
but they haven’t announced any besides the

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.690
cameos from the Agent Carter TV Show.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.320
Which I will now explain

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:22.010
Hayley Atwell will also be featured as Agent
Carter in a flashback during episode 1 with

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:23.010
the Howling Commandos.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:32.160
I’m going to do more videos for that show
when it premieres later in the year.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:38.370
When SHIELD goes on break, Agent Carter will
air in the same timeslot.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:39.960
That will be sometime in January.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:52.150
That show just cast James D’Arcy from Broadchurch
as Edwin Jarvis.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:57.980
In the canon, he’ll be Howard Stark’s
real life butler that Tony Stark later immortalizes

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:59.880
by turning into his AI.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:03.680
And eventually into The Vision during Avengers
2.

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:05.850
So if it’s a little confusing, the voice
of JARVIS is paul bettany, this new person

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:08.050
is playing the life that character is based
on.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:11.140
Oh, and if I haven’t mentioned it before
Dominic Cooper will be appearing as Howard

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.710
Stark on that show.

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:16.720
I don’t think we’ll see him in any Agents
of SHIELD flashbacks.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:20.410
I know it’s all starting to bleed together
in our heads.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.850
Agents Of SHIELD premieres next Tuesday at
9PM on ABC.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:26.170
That’s one hour later than last year.

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:30.900
I do know that FOX will air the episodes in
Asian Countries.

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:33.230
In the UK it’s on Channel 4.

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:35.430
For other countries just check your local
listings.

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:38.851
I don’t know when international episodes
are airing but you might have to wait a week

00:06:38.851 --> 00:06:42.340
or find another way to watch it.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:45.640
Here’s what’s going to happen with my
videos for it.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:48.060
SHIELD and Flash air on the same night.

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:53.010
Flash is first so those videos will always
go up first.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:07:01.940
What I’ll probably be doing is posting my
SHIELD videos the next morning.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.770
Next week will be a little different.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:09.419
I’ll probably be posting my flash video
extra early, so my SHIELD Episode 1 video

00:07:09.419 --> 00:07:10.530
will post Tuesday Night.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.840
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:15.250
I will be live tweeting while it’s on TV.

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:17.250
All my social links are in the description.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:21.150
I’m pretty good about not being spoilery,
but it’s a fun way to talk to people during

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:22.150
